# Reconcile — Auto Statement on Account Select

When Jerry selects a **bank or credit card** on the Reconcile screen, the app must **not** leave him on a blank Begin screen or attach the wrong statement month.

## Procedure (all Cohen entities)

On account select (no manual date pick):

1. **OPEN recon exists** for that account → resume that statement date; open the **main reconcile worksheet** (check-off screen), not Begin-only.
2. **No OPEN session, last period not CLOSED** (never started) → load the **first unreconciled** configured target (e.g. January 2026).
3. **Last period CLOSED** → advance to the **next unreconciled** statement (RECONCILIATION_TARGETS → bundled JSON → calendar month-end); skip any date that already has a CLOSED session.
4. **Attach statement PDF** for that account **kind** (bank vs card — see `statement-attach-account-kind.mdc`); populate beginning/ending balances from statement or OPEN session.
5. **Auto-import statement lines to the register** — parse discovered PDF, merge bundled JSON, post card charges / bank activity (`lib/reconcile-auto-statement-import.js`) so the worksheet is not empty.
6. **Populate the reconcile window** — balances, register worksheet, side-by-side PDF.

## Implementation map

| Layer | File |
|---|---|
| Next-period logic | `lib/reconcile-prepare.js` → `resolveUnreconciledStatementDate`, `prepareReconciliation` |
| PDF attach (account kind) | `lib/statement-file-locate.js` |
| Ending balances | `config/bank-import-targets.js` → `RECONCILIATION_TARGETS` |
| UI auto-open worksheet | `frontend/src/qbd/QBDReconcile.jsx` → `runPrepare` + `?go=1` |
| Tab open with OPEN recon | `GET /api/reconciliation/bank/resume-open` |

## Forbidden

- Defaulting to newest bundled JSON when an OPEN session exists for a sister entity
- Attaching Simmons bank PDF to a Chase card account (or vice versa)
- Leaving Jerry on Begin Reconciliation when prepare has a valid next period + balances

## Copilot verify

After changes: select OMC **1000** and **2011** — January when open; February (or next target) after January CLOSED; worksheet loads without an extra Continue click.
